    "reviews": "\u201cStories from Sol: The Gun-Dog masterfully blends retro-inspired visuals with modern storytelling, delivering a gripping sci-fi narrative filled with player-driven choices and Lovecraftian tension.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cGun-Dog is a fine ambassador for the PC-98, the adventure genre as a whole, but most importantly of all: itself. Good ideas, done well, are timeless.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cStories from Sol: The Gun-Dog is a wonderful sci-fi throwback, with classic point and click gameplay and a whole lot of charm.\u201d<br>9.0 \u2013 Loot Level Chill<br>",
